<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $46-1/4 (FIM 211.36).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $46-1/4 (FIM 211.36).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $0-1/4 at $46-1/4 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 211.36 markka. In Helsinki on Wednesday, Nokia A closed down 7.00 markka at 209.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed flat at $32 on Wall Street. The price equals about 73.12 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 1.20 markka at 72.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded on Wednesday after closing unchanged at $18 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Rauma closed down 1.50 at 85.00 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
